			<<link [[키카드를 훔친다|Asylum Keycard]]>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>> <<note "의심도가 낮을수록 더 쉽다" "italic">>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[그렇지 않다고 우긴다|Asylum Hurt Meek]]>><<awareness -1>><<stress 3>><</link>><<lawareness>><<gstress>>
		<br>
